{
  "rationale": "Use a small sensor plant plus a motion-capability plant, then encode the exploration policy in compact deterministic specifications. The policy favors random_walk in clear/search, inserts a short move_forward pulse after clear exploration for coverage, and uses one-shot turn recovery on obstacle events. Uncontrollable events are total in every specification state, with path_clear usually self-looping in action/commit states and obstacle events forcing safe recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate sensing and actuation into simple plants and place behavior in specifications",
    "Bias clear-space behavior toward random_walk and short forward pulses, while obstacle states allow only directed turn recovery",
    "Return quickly to exploration on path_clear and reserve full_rotate for a dedicated blocked escape state only"
  ],
